            "block_content": " $$ \\tilde{Q}(z):=(z-1)^{2}Q(z)=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}1&(z-1)^{2}&(z-1)^{2}(z+1)\\ $ z-1)^{2}&(z-1)^{2}z^{2}&(z-1)^{2}z\\ $ z-1)^{2}(z+1)&(z-1)^{2}z&(z-1)\\end{array}\\right) $$ ",
